<title>GREECE: PUBLISHER PSYHARIS APPOINTED GOVERNOR OF AGIO OROS.</title>
<headline>PUBLISHER PSYHARIS APPOINTED GOVERNOR OF AGIO OROS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The publisher of Greece's Sunday Vima newspaper, Stavros Psyharis, was appointed governor of Mount Athos (Agio Oros), and Aristos Camiroglou deputy governor, the foreign ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>Psyharis is also on the board of directors of state Olympic Airways. --Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
